<title>USA: International Nursing to buy Cymedix.</title>
<headline>International Nursing to buy Cymedix.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Nursing services Inc said Wednesday it signed a non-binding letter of intent to buy private Cymedix Corp for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>International Nursing said it would provide the California medical software company with bridge financing of up to $297,500 in convertible loans for a 130-day period.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available to elaborate on the deal.</p>
<p>The company's stock traded at 11/64, up 1/64 but close to its 52-week low of 1/8.</p>
</text>
